      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZINFANDEL BUCK (6) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Gigglin' (34.87) in a Grade 6/MDN. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Sure to be about the mark. MESSINA MISS (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing fourth (30.91) from Box 4 at Gawler over 531m. The form out of her last race has been franked. Has ability and can measure up. STOMP ROCKER (3) could manage only second at this track last time but caught the eye when posting a speedy 30.53 over 530m at this track the start prior. Must include on winning run two back. SCOTT SCOTCH (2) should be thereabouts.",
